{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB節目《美食強人》中，一道普通的西多士竟引發星級廚師間的激烈辯論！一眾名廚試食後，對其甜度評價出現極端兩極化，場面火花四濺。究竟一道甜品應該有多甜才算完美？這場專業級的味覺對決，讓觀眾見識到何謂「各執一詞」。\n</p>\n<h2>名廚試食西多士 甜度評價超兩極</h2>\n<p>在節目中，一眾食評家品嚐其中一間食店的西多士，其甜度卻引來截然不同的反應。「化學系靚廚」鄭紫欣首先表示，食第一啖時感覺有驚喜，但隨着份量增加，到最後卻覺得整體太甜，有點難以入口。而「連續 7 年米芝蓮三星食府主理人」黃隆滔更用幽默的方式表達了同感，他搞笑地和應道：「甜係可以嘅，不過呢個係失戀或好唔開心先食嘅！」言下之意，這種甜度已經超越了日常享受的範圍，更像是一種情緒的宣洩。</p>\n<h2>周世韜李文星力撐夠甜先正！金句反擊：「唔甜食嚟做咩？」</h2>\n<p>然而，並非所有人都認同過甜的說法。「唐述營運及廚藝總監」周世韜就持有完全相反的意見，他大讚道：「我覺得好正，個味道依然喺個腦度。」可見他對這份甜膩相當回味。名廚李文星的反應則更為直接，他毫不客氣地反駁認為太甜的說法，更拋出金句：「食得甜品你就預咗係甜㗎啦，咁如果唔係食甜品嚟做咩呢？我覺得個甜係正常囉。」他認為甜品的核心就在於「甜」，對此提出質疑是多此一舉，一番話令現場氣氛再度升溫。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議甜度標準：甜品梗係要夠甜！</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，名廚之間的激辯迅速引起網民熱議，大家對於甜品的「甜度標準」也紛紛發表意見。不少網民力撐李文星的說法：「李文星講得啱，食甜品就係要夠甜！」、「香港啲西多士就係要甜到漏先正宗，唔甜不如唔好食。」但也有人認同另一方：「其實我都怕太甜，鄭紫欣講中我心聲，食到最後會好膩。」、「黃隆滔個比喻好好笑，失戀專用西多士！」、「專業廚師都有唔同意見，證明口味真係好個人。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/01a_2136131506ae2dabe7a21a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/01a_2136131506ae2dabe7a21a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_3520182786ae2dac2df1ee.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/02_3520182786ae2dac2df1ee.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_16010523696ae2dac5af266.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/03_16010523696ae2dac5af266.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_1113529116ae2dac88c0cb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/04_1113529116ae2dac88c0cb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_7013988296ae2dacc33bb2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/05_7013988296ae2dacc33bb2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_13176743966ae2dacf5a6e1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06_13176743966ae2dacf5a6e1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_432140306ae2dad2b99b6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/07_432140306ae2dad2b99b6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_19689323436ae2dad5e1ab3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/08_19689323436ae2dad5e1ab3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_16890305606ae2dad9222dd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/09_16890305606ae2dad9222dd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_11925871736ae2dadc19c3e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/10_11925871736ae2dadc19c3e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_15857905216ae2dadec00a7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_15857905216ae2dadec00a7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_20117113806ae2dae2aa734.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/12_20117113806ae2dae2aa734.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_2265721316ae2dae59ef7d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/13_2265721316ae2dae59ef7d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_9014119416ae2db0cc3528.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_9014119416ae2db0cc3528.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_6740718486ae2db0f88fe9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_6740718486ae2db0f88fe9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T14:22:02.400060+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1114,"images":15,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","comple